      "subject": "tadacit (tameṭṭut n Sunem)",
      "rationale": "Elisha yemmeslay i Gehazi ad yini i tmeṭṭut; aswel usrid i kečč."
    },
    {
      "kind": "idiom",
      "subject": "בתוך עמי אנכי יושבת",
      "rationale": "Deg wemmas n ugdud-iw nekkin ttiddeɣ — tigawt tamaynut: ulac ayen iwumi ḥwajen, qqimeɣ gar leqbayel-iw."
    },
    {
      "kind": "substitution",
      "subject": "txerḍeḍ",
      "rationale": "חרדת d axerreḍ (tagrawla), maca da γur-es unamek n tḥercit d useɣres: txedmeḍ i nehnay akk ayagi s tḥerci."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Yenna-yas: Ini-yas-as: Ata, txerḍeḍ ɣefneɣ ⟨את⟩ txerḍa-agi akk. Acu ara d-nexdem i kečč? Is ilaq ad d-nmeslay i kečč ɣer ugellid, neɣ ɣer umḍab n yiserdasen? Tenna-d: Deg wemmas n ugdud-iw, nekkin ttiddeɣ.",
